      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0a8906d9b36ccd4c",
      "translationZh": "发布 Artificial Analysis Capability Indices v1.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "652d59aadd6b9c62",
      "translationZh": "我们正在更新 Capability Indices v1.1，强化针对各领域的调优，将核心 Intelligence Index v4.3 评测中按领域划分的部分与专项评测相结合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3639dbd6faf38f3",
      "translationZh": "Capability Indices 将 O*NET 职业中的任务映射到能够代表这些任务的基准测试，并根据每项基准测试所衡量的能力在各项任务中出现的频率，为该基准测试赋予权重。Capability Indices v1.1 纳入了 Intelligence Index v4.2 和 v4.3 的更新，并在可行时按领域划分评测内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de8bbbb551b48a0c",
      "translationZh": "智能体工具使用（AutomationBench-AA，金融）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
